<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA BEAT POLAND 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA BEAT POLAND 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia beat Poland 4-1 in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two, third round tie after sharing the reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Slovak names first):</p>
<p>Karol Kucera beat Bartolomiej Dobrowski 6-7 (2-7) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty lost to Michal Gawlowski 7-6 (7-1) 3-6 5-7</p>
</text>
